<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on publishing stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on publishing stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Steven Barlow initiated coverage of the publishing stock sector.</p>
<p>-- started the following as strong buy: Gannett Co Inc and New York Times Co.  </p>
<p>-- began coverage of the following as buy: Tribune Co; Valassis Communications Inc ; McGraw-Hill Cos Inc ; and Hollinger Inc.</p>
<p>-- initiated the following as hold: Dow Jones &amp; Co Inc ; Times Mirror Co ; and Washington Post Co.</p>
</text>
